This directory is used by the host-side `./q9` launcher.

`./q9 run 'command'` writes a temporary `run.rc` here.  Glenda's profile
sources that file when the guest boots with `q9mode=text`.

`./q9 --kernel name` writes a temporary generated PXE profile under
`cfg/pxe` while QEMU is starting, then removes it when the launcher exits.
